//t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8077d5668440f54406a36df4d7d5046eb06e7a86\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8077d5668440f54406a36df4d7d5046eb06e7a86\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52981d9e034dcb7bc95b12d100508a4b4fbb5a61\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52981d9e034dcb7bc95b12d100508a4b4fbb5a61\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">빈 종이와, 표가 그려진 종이를 인쇄하여 <br><br>나눠주고 활동했습니다 <br><br>숫자 1~50 써놓고 하던 게임을 <br><br>응용해보았습니다 <br><br>어릴 때 많이 하던 게임인데, <br><br>아이들은 잘 모르더라구요.. <br><br>아이들에게 알려주려고 <br><br>설명을 적어보았는데 <br><br>글만으로 전달이 잘 될지 모르겠지만 <br><br>유용하게 사용하셨으면 좋겠습니다</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a66b28bccddfa5238b0549e1208b315344d4484?download\" data-file-name=\"원소기호_zerosilver847_howtoedutech.hwp\" data-file-size=\"65024\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D305%26fileid%3D13%26regdt%3D20210317171213&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1a66b28bccddfa5238b0549e1208b315344d4484')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">원소기호_zerosilver847_howtoedutech</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">63.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">저는 양식을 만들었는데.. 자르기가 너무 귀찮아서..</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그냥 아이들에게 표를 그리라고 하는 게 좋을 것 같아요~!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
